{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ChS2K \u2013 DC electric locomotive for passenger trains</strong><br>A modernized version of the classic ChS2, designed for 3 kV DC lines. Used on Ukrainian, Russian, and Belarusian railways for express and long-distance services.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Technical specifications:</strong><br>\u2022 Voltage: 3 kV DC<br>\u2022 Power: 5100 kW<br>\u2022 Max speed: 160 km/h<br>\u2022 Axle arrangement: 2o-2o+2o-2o<br>\u2022 Weight: ~168 t<br>\u2022 Tractive effort: up to 245 kN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2013 High-quality 3D model with an animated driver\u2019s cab<br>\u2013 Fully functional instruments and controls<br>\u2013 Authentic sounds of traction motors, compressor, and relays<br>\u2013 Realistic physics and driving behavior<br>\u2013 Compatible with ZDSimulator routes and scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 Requires the base game <strong>ZDSimulator</strong> to play.<br>Wishlist the DLC and support the development!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614820?t=1744917866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614820/2ca94f440738b76d6aec8c2282517f6f4bf9cf8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614820/93dd167dff35a092381c7b4f1aa2ffd466a7fe2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614820/93dd167dff35a092381c7b4f1aa2ffd466a7fe2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917866","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ChS2K \u2013 DC electric locomotive for passenger trains</strong><br>A mo